// ::home - the teleport every player has, to Edgeville (engine: ClientCheatHandler).
//
// (2026-10-19) The engine used to teleJump the player itself after checking only combat and the
// Wilderness, so it skipped everything a real teleport refuses: a duel (walk out on a losing stake),
// Castle Wars (take the enemy's banner home for good), the trawler, a random event, Ana in her barrel,
// carrying the monkey - and ~p_telejump_safe's rum, plague sample and sled. Now the engine keeps its own
// checks (combat, Wilderness, instances) and then runs this, which is a teleport like any other.
[proc,home_teleport]
if (~pre_tele_checks(coord) = false) {
    return;
}
~p_telejump_safe(0_48_54_14_35);
if (coord = 0_48_54_14_35) {
    mes("You teleport home to Edgeville.");
}
